# Custom React Hooks

This folder will contain custom React hooks for state management and side effects.

## Structure
- `use-cart.ts` - Cart state management
- `use-auth.ts` - Authentication state
- `use-favorites.ts` - Wishlist management
- `use-local-storage.ts` - Local storage utilities
- `use-debounce.ts` - Debounced values

## Usage
```typescript
import { useCart } from '@/lib/hooks/use-cart'
```